\item[S4] David Zhang, research report answering MathOverflow question 339137, 16 June 2026. \url{https://mathoverflow.net/questions/339137/why-do-polynomials-with-coefficients-0-1-like-to-have-only-factors-with-0-1}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

